                            rel="noopener noreferrer">
                            <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">JRTC 26-10 JFE&nbsp;→</h5>
                            <p class="news-url link-secondary fst-italic"><small>https://www.dvidshub.net/image/9935865/jrtc-26-10-jfe</small></p>
                            <p class="card-text"><strong>August 26, 2026 &mdash;</strong> A Paratrooper assigned to 2nd Mobile Brigade Combat Team, 82nd Airborne Division assesses coordinates with an Android Tactical Assault Kit (ATAK) during a Joint Readiness Training Center (JRTC) rotation at Fort Polk, Louisiana. Paratroopers are tasked with attacking and defending themselves from enemy forces throughout the duration of JRTC in order to complete the mission at hand. (U.S. Army photo by Spc. Sebastian Johnston)</p>
                        </a>
